    "card_no": '4',
    "term":'<p class="qz-txt"><b>An 8-year-old female presents with worsening headaches over the&#x00A0;past 3&#x00A0;weeks and has now started to vomit on waking in the morning. She reports the headache is a dull pain in the back of her head. She&#x00A0;has&#x00A0;intermittent blurry vision, and her parents note she stumbles when&#x00A0;walking&#x00A0;more recently. She is scheduled for an MRI.</b></p><div class="key1"><p><b>What would be the most likely finding on imaging?</b></p></div>',
    "termaudio":"",
    "defnaudio":"",
